":"Er Yurci Hot Springs","legend":"A geothermal springs with naturally heated water that provide relaxation and medicinal benefits. Average temperature is 34°C."},{"id":"marker2","name":"Nympliostos Fountain of Youth","legend":"This legendary water source is whispered about in ancient tales and believed to possess mystical properties. The spring emanates crystal-clear water, shimmering with an otherworldly iridescence that sparkles even in the dimmest light."},{"id":"marker3","name":"Epekibi — salt mining town","legend":"Epekibi is a mining town of 2178 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker4","name":"Paphyzan — copper mining town","legend":"Paphyzan is a mining town of 5830 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker5","name":"Kalkan — iron mining town","legend":"Kalkan is a mining town of 1652 people just nearby the iron mine."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Ormsterham — salt mining town","legend":"Ormsterham is a mining town of 7066 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker7","name":"The Light Narwhal","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious mashed apples with pink whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker8","name":"The New Raven","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious dressed pepper with orange absinthe is served here."},{"id":"marker9","name":"The Loud Wolf","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious mashed wolf with brown liquor is served here."},{"id":"marker10","name":"The New Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious stewed teal with smoky spirits is served here."},{"id":"marker11","name":"The Pink Raven","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled pike with purple whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker12","name":"The Frozen Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious braised garlic with purple liquor is served here."},{"id":"marker13","name":"The Honest Fox","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dry-aged onions with fire rom is served here."